rows.en:
"...Well then, I'd like to wrap things up for today.
Thank you all very much."
When I said my goodbyes, everyone nodded one after another.{p}

"Well, goodbye, everyone.
I'll walk Fukuzawa home."
Hosoda stood up.{p}

"Um..."
"Hm, what is it?"
"Was your story true, Kazama?"{p}

Kazama was running toward me at an incredible speed.
Wasn't his stomach supposed to hurt?
What on earth is with this guy...★{p}

"I think I'll head home for today.
I'll come by to visit again sometime."
A meaningful little smile.{p}

"Ow, ow... {b}, that's mean."
"Oh, I'm sorry.
But you suddenly put your arm around my shoulders."{p}

"La la la la~ The young ones sing~ for the love of tomorrow~"
I put my arm around Kazama's shoulders.
Swaying and singing like this felt like a fitting way to end today's meeting...{p}

Fine, as long as he protects me.
When I leaned into him, I heard a whistle from somewhere.
"Who's that, teasing us... hm?"{p}

"...Yes.
I knew it all along.
That if we held a seven wonders gathering, something was sure to happen..."{p}

..................As if I could write that up!
My shoulders slumped.
Above my head, the birds' chirping echoed like laughter.{p}

"I'm home..."
"Welcome back. You're late."
Mom touched my shoulder.{p}
